{"suttaId":"pv10","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Pv","vriCode":"s0507m.mul","paras":[203,249],"vripara":"58"},"segments":{"pv10:0.3":"Khallāṭiyapetivatthu","pv10:1.1":"“Kā nu antovimānasmiṃ, tiṭṭhantī nūpanikkhami;","pv10:1.3":"Upanikkhamassu bhadde, passāma taṃ bahiṭṭhitan”ti.","pv10:2.1":"“Aṭṭīyāmi harāyāmi, naggā nikkhamituṃ bahi;","pv10:2.3":"Kesehamhi paṭicchannā, puññaṃ me appakaṃ katan”ti.","pv10:3.1":"“Handuttarīyaṃ dadāmi te, idaṃ dussaṃ nivāsaya;","pv10:3.3":"Idaṃ dussaṃ nivāsetvā, ehi nikkhama sobhane;","pv10:3.5":"Upanikkhamassu bhadde, passāma taṃ bahiṭṭhitan”ti.","pv10:4.1":"“Hatthena hatthe te dinnaṃ, na mayhaṃ upakappati;","pv10:4.3":"Esetthupāsako saddho, sammāsambuddhasāvako.","pv10:5.1":"“Etaṃ acchādayitvāna, mama dakkhiṇamādisa;","pv10:5.3":"Tathāhaṃ [athāhaṃ (sī.)] sukhitā hessaṃ, sabbakāmasamiddhinī”ti.","pv10:6.1":"Tañca te nhāpayitvāna, vilimpetvāna vāṇijā;","pv10:6.3":"Vatthehacchādayitvāna, tassā dakkhiṇamādisuṃ.","pv10:7.1":"Samanantarānuddiṭṭhe [samanantarā anuddiṭṭhe (syā. ka.)], vipāko udapajjatha [upapajjatha (sī. syā.)];","pv10:7.3":"Bhojanacchādanapānīyaṃ [bhojanacchādanaṃ pānīyaṃ (syā. ka.)], dakkhiṇāya idaṃ phalaṃ.","pv10:8.1":"Tato suddhā sucivasanā, kāsikuttamadhārinī;","pv10:8.3":"Hasantī vimānā nikkhami,‘dakkhiṇāya idaṃ phalan’”ti.","pv10:9.1":"“Sucittarūpaṃ ruciraṃ, vimānaṃ te pabhāsati;","pv10:9.3":"Devate pucchitācikkha, kissa kammassidaṃ phalan”ti.","pv10:10.1":"“Bhikkhuno caramānassa, doṇinimmajjaniṃ ahaṃ;","pv10:10.3":"Adāsiṃ ujubhūtassa, vippasannena cetasā.","pv10:11.1":"“Tassa kammassa kusalassa, vipākaṃ dīghamantaraṃ;","pv10:11.3":"Anubhomi vimānasmiṃ, tañca dāni parittakaṃ.","pv10:12.1":"“Uddhaṃ catūhi māsehi, kālaṃkiriyā [kālaṃkiriyā (ka.)] bhavissati;","pv10:12.3":"Ekantakaṭukaṃ ghoraṃ, nirayaṃ papatissahaṃ.","pv10:13.1":"[ma. ni.3.250,267; a. ni.3.36; pe. va.240,693]“Catukkaṇṇaṃ catudvāraṃ, vibhattaṃ bhāgaso mitaṃ;","pv10:13.3":"Ayopākārapariyantaṃ, ayasā paṭikujjitaṃ.","pv10:14.1":"“Tassa ayomayā bhūmi, jalitā tejasā yutā;","pv10:14.3":"Samantā yojanasataṃ, pharitvā tiṭṭhati sabbadā.","pv10:15.1":"“Tatthāhaṃ dīghamaddhānaṃ, dukkhaṃ vedissa vedanaṃ;","pv10:15.3":"Phalañca pāpakammassa, tasmā socāmahaṃ bhusan”ti.","pv10:16.1":"Khallāṭiyapetivatthu dasamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Pv-a","bookName":"Petavatthu-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0507a.att","from":355,"to":417,"paras":[{"para":355,"vripara":null,"refs":["pv10:1"],"lines":["Gāthamāha.","Tattha <b>kā nu antovimānasmiṃ tiṭṭhantī</b>ti vimānassa anto abbhantare tiṭṭhantī kā nu tvaṃ, kiṃ manussitthī, udāhu amanussitthīti pucchati.","<b>Nūpanikkhamī</b>ti vimānato na nikkhami.","<b>Upanikkhamassu, bhadde, passāma taṃ bahiṭṭhitan</b>ti, bhadde, taṃ mayaṃ bahi ṭhitaṃ passāma daṭṭhukāmamhā, tasmā vimānato nikkhamassu.","“Upanikkhamassu bhaddante”ti vā pāṭho, bhaddaṃ te atthūti attho."],"lineRefs":[["pv10:1"],["pv10:1"],["pv10:1"],["pv10:1"],["pv10:1"]]},{"para":356,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Athassa sā attano bahi nikkhamisuṃ asakkuṇeyyataṃ pakāsentī –"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":358,"vripara":"59","refs":[],"lines":["“Aṭṭīyāmi harāyāmi, naggā nikkhamituṃ bahi;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":359,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kesehamhi paṭicchannā, puññaṃ me appakaṃ katan”ti.","–"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":360,"vripara":null,"refs":["pv10:2"],"lines":["Gāthamāha.","Tattha <b>aṭṭīyāmī</b>ti naggā hutvā bahi nikkhamituṃ aṭṭikā dukkhitā amhi.","<b>Harāyāmī</b>ti lajjāmi.","<b>Kesehamhi paṭicchannā</b>ti kesehi amhi ahaṃ paṭicchāditā pārutasarīrā.","<b>Puññaṃ me appakaṃ katan</b>ti appakaṃ parittaṃ mayā kusalakammaṃ kataṃ, piññākadānamattanti adhippāyo."],"lineRefs":[["pv10:2"],["pv10:2"],["pv10:2"],["pv10:2"],["pv10:2"]]},{"para":361,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Athassā vāṇijo attano uttarisāṭakaṃ dātukāmo –-"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":363,"vripara":"60","refs":[],"lines":["“Handuttarīyaṃ dadāmi te, idaṃ dussaṃ nivāsaya;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":364,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Idaṃ dussaṃ nivāsetvā, ehi nikkhama sobhane;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":365,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Upanikkhamassu bhadde, passāma taṃ bahiṭṭhitan”ti.","–"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":366,"vripara":null,"refs":["pv10:3"],"lines":["Gāthamāha.","Tattha <b>handā</b>ti gaṇha.","<b>Uttarīyan</b>ti upasaṃbyānaṃ uttarisāṭakanti attho.","<b>Dadāmi te</b>ti tuyhaṃ dadāmi.","<b>Idaṃ dussaṃ nivāsayā</b>ti idaṃ mama uttarisāṭakaṃ tvaṃ nivāsehi.","<b>Sobhane</b>ti sundararūpe."],"lineRefs":[["pv10:3"],["pv10:3"],["pv10:3"],["pv10:3"],["pv10:3"],["pv10:3"]]},{"para":367,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Evañca pana vatvā attano uttarisāṭakaṃ tassā upanesi, sā tathā diyyamānassa attano anupakappanīyatañca, yathā diyyamānaṃ upakappati, tañca dassentī –"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":369,"vripara":"61","refs":[],"lines":["“Hatthena hatthe te dinnaṃ, na mayhaṃ upakappati;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":370,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Esetthupāsako saddho, sammāsambuddhasāvako."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":372,"vripara":"62","refs":[],"lines":["“Etaṃ acchādayitvāna, mama dakkhiṇamādisa;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":373,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tathāhaṃ sukhitā hessaṃ, sabbakāmasamiddhinī”ti.","–"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":374,"vripara":null,"refs":["pv10:5"],"lines":["Gāthādvayamāha.","Tattha <b>hatthena hatthe te dinnaṃ, na mayhaṃ upakappatī</b>ti, mārisa, tava hatthena mama hatthe tayā dinnaṃ na mayhaṃ upakappati na viniyujjati, upabhogayoggaṃ na hotīti attho.","<b>Esetthupāsako saddho</b>ti eso ratanattayaṃ uddissa saraṇagamanena upāsako kammaphalasaddhāya ca samannāgatattā saddho ettha etasmiṃ janasamūhe atthi.","<b>Etaṃ acchādayitvāna, mama dakkhiṇamādisā</b>ti etaṃ upāsakaṃ mama diyyamānaṃ sāṭakaṃ paridahāpetvā taṃ dakkhiṇaṃ mayhaṃ ādisa pattidānaṃ dehi.","<b>Tathāhaṃ sukhitā hessan</b>ti tathā kate ahaṃ sukhitā dibbavatthanivatthā sukhappattā bhavissāmīti."],"lineRefs":[["pv10:5"],["pv10:5"],["pv10:5"],["pv10:5"],["pv10:5"]]},{"para":375,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Taṃ sutvā vāṇijā taṃ upāsakaṃ nhāpetvā vilimpetvā vatthayugena acchādesuṃ.","Tamatthaṃ pakāsentā saṅgītikārā –"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":377,"vripara":"63","refs":[],"lines":["“Tañca te nhāpayitvāna, vilimpetvāna vāṇijā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":378,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Vatthehacchādayitvāna, tassā dakkhiṇamādisuṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":380,"vripara":"64","refs":[],"lines":["“Samanantarānuddiṭṭhe, vipāko udapajjatha;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":381,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Bhojanacchādanapānīyaṃ, dakkhiṇāya idaṃ phalaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":383,"vripara":"65","refs":[],"lines":["“Tato suddhā sucivasanā, kāsikuttamadhārinī;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":384,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Hasantī vimānā nikkhami, dakkhiṇāya idaṃ phalan”ti.","–"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":385,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tisso gāthāyo avocuṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":386,"vripara":"63","refs":["pv10:6"],"lines":["Tattha <b>tan</b>ti taṃ upāsakaṃ.","Ca-saddo nipātamattaṃ.","<b>Te</b>ti te vāṇijāti yojanā.","<b>Vilimpetvānā</b>ti uttamena gandhena vilimpetvā.","<b>Vatthehacchādayitvānā</b>ti vaṇṇagandharasasampannaṃ sabyañjanaṃ bhojanaṃ bhojetvā nivāsanaṃ uttarīyanti dvīhi vatthehi acchādesuṃ, dve vatthāni adaṃsūti attho.","<b>Tassā dakkhiṇamādisun</b>ti tassā petiyā taṃ dakkhiṇaṃ ādisiṃsu."],"lineRefs":[["pv10:6"],["pv10:6"],["pv10:6"],["pv10:6"],["pv10:6"],["pv10:6"]]},{"para":387,"vripara":"64","refs":["pv10:7"],"lines":["<b>Samanantarānuddiṭṭhe</b>ti <b>anū</b>-ti nipātamattaṃ, tassā dakkhiṇāya uddiṭṭhasamanantarameva.","<b>Vipāko udapajjathā</b>ti tassā petiyā vipāko dakkhiṇāya phalaṃ uppajji.","Kīdisoti petī āha <b>bhojanacchādanapānīyan</b>ti.","Nānappakāraṃ dibbabhojanasadisaṃ bhojanañca nānāvirāgavaṇṇasamujjalaṃ dibbavatthasadisaṃ vatthañca anekavidhaṃ pānakañca <b>dakkhiṇāya idaṃ</b> īdisaṃ <b>phalaṃ udapajjathā</b>ti yojanā."],"lineRefs":[["pv10:7"],["pv10:7"],["pv10:7"],["pv10:7"]]},{"para":388,"vripara":"65","refs":["pv10:8"],"lines":["<b>Tato</b>ti yathāvuttabhojanādipaṭilābhato pacchā.","<b>Suddhā</b>ti nhānena suddhasarīrā.","<b>Sucivasanā</b>ti suvisuddhavatthanivatthā.","<b>Kāsikuttamadhārinī</b>ti kāsikavatthatopi uttamavatthadhārinī.","<b>Hasantī</b>ti “passatha tāva tumhākaṃ dakkhiṇāya idaṃ phalavisesan”ti pakāsanavasena hasamānā vimānato nikkhami."],"lineRefs":[["pv10:8"],["pv10:8"],["pv10:8"],["pv10:8"],["pv10:8"]]},{"para":389,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Atha te vāṇijā evaṃ paccakkhato puññaphalaṃ disvā acchariyabbhutacittajātā tasmiṃ upāsake sañjātagāravabahumānā katañjalī taṃ payirupāsiṃsu.","Sopi te dhammakathāya bhiyyosomattāya pasādetvā saraṇesu ca sīlesu ca patiṭṭhāpesi.","Te tāya vimānapetiyā katakammaṃ –"],"lineRefs":[[],[],[]]},{"para":391,"vripara":"66","refs":[],"lines":["“Sucittarūpaṃ ruciraṃ, vimānaṃ te pabhāsati;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":392,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Devate pucchitācikkha, kissa kammassidaṃ phalan”ti.","–"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":393,"vripara":null,"refs":["pv10:9"],"lines":["Imāya gāthāya pucchiṃsu.","Tattha <b>sucittarūpan</b>ti hatthiassaitthipurisādivasena ceva mālākammalatākammādivasena ca suṭṭhu vihitacittarūpaṃ.","<b>Ruciran</b>ti ramaṇīyaṃ dassanīyaṃ.","<b>Kissa kammassidaṃ phalan</b>ti kīdisassa kammassa, kiṃ dānamayassa udāhu sīlamayassa idaṃ phalanti attho."],"lineRefs":[["pv10:9"],["pv10:9"],["pv10:9"],["pv10:9"]]},{"para":394,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sā tehi evaṃ puṭṭhā “mayā katassa parittakassa kusalakammassa tāva idaṃ phalaṃ, akusalakammassa pana āyatiṃ niraye edisaṃ bhavissatī”ti tadubhayaṃ ācikkhantī –"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":396,"vripara":"67","refs":[],"lines":["“Bhikkhuno caramānassa, doṇinimmajjaniṃ ahaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":397,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Adāsiṃ ujubhūtassa, vippasannena cetasā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":399,"vripara":"68","refs":[],"lines":["“Tassa kammassa kusalassa, vipākaṃ dīghamantaraṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":400,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Anubhomi vimānasmiṃ, tañca dāni parittakaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":402,"vripara":"69","refs":[],"lines":["“Uddhaṃ catūhi māsehi, kālaṃkiriyā bhavissati;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":403,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ekantakaṭukaṃ ghoraṃ, nirayaṃ papatissahaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":405,"vripara":"70","refs":[],"lines":["“Catukkaṇṇaṃ catudvāraṃ, vibhattaṃ bhāgaso mitaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":406,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ayopākārapariyantaṃ, ayasā paṭikujjitaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":408,"vripara":"71","refs":[],"lines":["“Tassa ayomayā bhūmi, jalitā tejasā yutā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":409,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Samantā yojanasataṃ, pharitvā tiṭṭhati sabbadā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":411,"vripara":"72","refs":[],"lines":["“Tatthāhaṃ dīghamaddhānaṃ, dukkhaṃ vedissa vedanaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":412,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Phalañca pāpakammassa, tasmā socāmahaṃ bhusan”ti.","– gāthāyo abhāsi;"],"lineRefs":[[],[]]},{"para":413,"vripara":"67","refs":["pv10:10"],"lines":["Tattha <b>bhikkhuno caramānassā</b>ti aññatarassa bhinnakilesassa bhikkhuno bhikkhāya carantassa.","<b>Doṇinimmajjanin</b>ti vissandamānatelaṃ piññākaṃ.","<b>Ujubhūtassā</b>ti cittajimhavaṅkakuṭilabhāvakarānaṃ kilesānaṃ abhāvena ujubhāvappattassa.","<b>Vippasannena cetasā</b>ti kammaphalasaddhāya suṭṭhu pasannena cittena."],"lineRefs":[["pv10:10"],["pv10:10"],["pv10:10"],["pv10:10"]]},{"para":414,"vripara":"68-69","refs":["pv10:11"],"lines":["68-69. <b>Dīghamantaran</b>ti ma-kāro padasandhikaro, dīghaantaraṃ dīghakālanti attho.","<b>Tañca dāni parittakan</b>ti tañca puññaphalaṃ vipakkavipākattā kammassa idāni parittakaṃ appāvasesaṃ, na cireneva ito cavissāmīti attho.","Tenāha <b>“uddhaṃ catūhi māsehi, kālaṃkiriyā bhavissatī”</b>ti catūhi māsehi uddhaṃ catunnaṃ māsānaṃ upari pañcame māse mama kālaṃkiriyā bhavissatīti dasseti.","<b>Ekantakaṭukan</b>ti ekanteneva aniṭṭhachaphassāyatanikabhāvato ekantadukkhanti attho.","<b>Ghoran</b>ti dāruṇaṃ.","<b>Nirayan</b>ti natthi ettha ayo sukhanti katvā “nirayan”ti laddhanāmaṃ narakaṃ.","<b>Papatissahan</b>ti papahissāmi ahaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["pv10:11"],["pv10:11"],["pv10:11"],["pv10:11"],["pv10:11"],["pv10:11"],["pv10:11"]]},{"para":415,"vripara":"70","refs":["pv10:13"],"lines":["“Nirayan”ti cettha avīcimahānirayassa adhippetattā taṃ sarūpato dassetuṃ <b>“catukkaṇṇan”</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha <b>catukkaṇṇan</b>ti catukkoṇaṃ.","<b>Catudvāran</b>ti catūsu disāsu catūhi dvārehi yuttaṃ.","<b>Vibhattan</b>ti suṭṭhu vibhattaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["pv10:13"],["pv10:13"],["pv10:13"],["pv10:13"]]},{"para":416,"vripara":null,"refs":["pv10:13"],"lines":["<b>Bhāgaso</b>ti bhāgato.","<b>Mitan</b>ti tulitaṃ.","<b>Ayopākārapariyantan</b>ti ayomayena pākārena parikkhittaṃ.","<b>Ayasā paṭikujjitan</b>ti ayopaṭaleneva upari pihitaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["pv10:13"],["pv10:13"],["pv10:13"],["pv10:13"]]},{"para":417,"vripara":"71-72","refs":["pv10:14"],"lines":["71-72. <b>Tejasā yutā</b>ti samantato samuṭṭhitajālena mahatā agginā nirantaraṃ samāyutajālā.","<b>Samantā yojanasatan</b>ti evaṃ pana samantā bahi sabbadisāsu yojanasataṃ yojanānaṃ sataṃ.","<b>Sabbadā</b>ti sabbakālaṃ.","<b>Pharitvā tiṭṭhatī</b>ti byāpetvā tiṭṭhati.","<b>Tatthā</b>ti tasmiṃ mahāniraye.","<b>Vedissan</b>ti vedissāmi anubhavissāmi.","<b>Phalañca pāpakammassā</b>ti idaṃ īdisaṃ dukkhānubhavanaṃ mahā evaṃ katassa pāpassa kammassa phalanti attho."],"lineRefs":[["pv10:14"],["pv10:14"],["pv10:14"],["pv10:14"],["pv10:14"],["pv10:14"],["pv10:14"]]}],"wordLinks":[["pv10:1.1","kā nu antovimānasmiṃ tiṭṭhantī",0,1],["pv10:1.1","nūpanikkhamī",0,2],["pv10:1.3","upanikkhamassu bhadde passāma taṃ bahiṭṭhitaṃ",0,3],["pv10:2.1","aṭṭīyāmī",4,1],["pv10:2.1","harāyāmī",4,2],["pv10:2.3","kesehamhi paṭicchannā",4,3],["pv10:2.3","puññaṃ me appakaṃ kataṃ",4,4],["pv10:3.1","handā",9,1],["pv10:3.1","uttarīyaṃ",9,2],["pv10:3.1","dadāmi te",9,3],["pv10:3.1","idaṃ dussaṃ nivāsayā",9,4],["pv10:3.3","sobhane",9,5],["pv10:5.1","etaṃ acchādayitvāna mama dakkhiṇamādisā",15,3],["pv10:5.3","tathāhaṃ sukhitā hessaṃ",15,4],["pv10:6.1","te",24,2],["pv10:6.1","vilimpetvānā",24,3],["pv10:6.3","vatthehacchādayitvānā",24,4],["pv10:6.3","tassā dakkhiṇamādisuṃ",24,5],["pv10:7.1","samanantarānuddiṭṭhe",25,0],["pv10:7.1","vipāko udapajjathā",25,1],["pv10:7.3","bhojanacchādanapānīyaṃ",25,2],["pv10:7.3","dakkhiṇāya idaṃ",25,3],["pv10:8.1","tato",26,0],["pv10:8.1","suddhā",26,1],["pv10:8.1","sucivasanā",26,2],["pv10:8.1","kāsikuttamadhārinī",26,3],["pv10:8.3","hasantī",26,4],["pv10:9.1","sucittarūpaṃ",30,1],["pv10:9.1","ruciraṃ",30,2],["pv10:9.3","kissa kammassidaṃ phalaṃ",30,3],["pv10:10.1","bhikkhuno caramānassā",44,0],["pv10:10.1","doṇinimmajjaniṃ",44,1],["pv10:10.3","ujubhūtassā",44,2],["pv10:10.3","vippasannena cetasā",44,3],["pv10:11.1","dīghamantaraṃ",45,0],["pv10:11.3","tañca dāni parittakaṃ",45,1],["pv10:13.1","catukkaṇṇaṃ",46,0],["pv10:13.1","catukkaṇṇaṃ",46,1],["pv10:13.1","catudvāraṃ",46,2],["pv10:13.1","vibhattaṃ",46,3],["pv10:13.1","bhāgaso",47,0],["pv10:13.1","mitaṃ",47,1],["pv10:13.3","ayopākārapariyantaṃ",47,2],["pv10:13.3","ayasā paṭikujjitaṃ",47,3],["pv10:14.1","tejasā yutā",48,0],["pv10:14.3","samantā yojanasataṃ",48,1],["pv10:14.3","sabbadā",48,2],["pv10:14.3","pharitvā tiṭṭhatī",48,3]]},"tika":null}
